ONE hunk, a REPLACEMENT of one line by 23 lines (old side 7, new side 29). The removed line is `:1196`. The context is 3 lines above (`:1193`-`:1195`) and 3 below (`:1197`-`:1199`); every context line is non-blank. Every `+` line is given byte for byte below, leading spaces included (the first three are comments at SIX spaces; `content: {` is at SIX spaces, as the removed line was).

