Measured on the golden: the one edit point reverted (product back to the tip, test file kept), golden restored after (`cmp` True): D1, D2 and D3 RED, by ASSERTION (3 failed / 3 passed / 6); C1-C3 green. Byte-uniqueness of the replaced line: `      content: { 'application/json': { schema: DelegationSchema } },` count 1 at the tip (`grep -c -F`).

